# Environment variables for samplekata.
#
# Copy this file to `.env` (which is gitignored) and fill in real values.
# Document each variable here — the `aikata doctor` check verifies that
# every entry in `.env.example` is mentioned in `AGENTS.md` or
# `ARCHITECTURE.md`.

# Example:
# DATABASE_URL=postgres://user:pass@localhost:5432/samplekata
# NODE_ENV=development
# LOG_LEVEL=info
